<title>FINLAND: TABLE - FINLAND BANK RESERVES UP FIM 457 MLN IN WEEK.</title>
<headline>TABLE - FINLAND BANK RESERVES UP FIM 457 MLN IN WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest</p>
<p>balance sheet for the week to July 31 showed the following</p>
<p>positions in millions of markka compared to July 23.</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 64,475	64,019</p>
<p> Money market intervention    10,575	10,575</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,921	 1,921</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 1,908	 1,908</p>
<p> Other				 7,995	 7,899</p>
<p> Total assets		     86,874	86,322</p>
<p>In the previous week to July 23 reserves rose by 2.1 billion</p>
<p>markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
